WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Luke dashes after the prerequisite No Chaser knockdown.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.200
Standing heavy kick hits Ryu as he rises.

3
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.000
Crouching heavy punch follows the heavy kick.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.950
The Avenger punch follow-up completes the conversion.

6
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.750
Ryu lands after No Chaser.
